      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10456374::web::013::3_4_tribocorrosion_performance_after_ann"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The AlCrTiZrMo film annealed at 800 °C for 1 hour has better tribocorrosion resistance and a lower wear rate than the as-deposited film.",
